WEBVTT

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:16.620
Mom...

00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:24.280
What are you doing here?

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:31.660
Why do you look just like you did when you left me?

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:39.310
Why? Why?

00:00:41.110 --> 00:00:44.060
Mom, give me an answer!

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:20.660
Intruder detected in the Alicia Room!

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:22.890
There's only one target!

00:02:22.890 --> 00:02:24.380
Block off the halls!

00:02:24.380 --> 00:02:25.240
Freeze!

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:29.680
Stop.

00:02:32.650 --> 00:02:35.760
It's dangerous here, Commander Izumo! Please, leave at once!

00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:37.410
Izumo?

00:02:38.390 --> 00:02:39.260
You!

00:02:42.550 --> 00:02:45.010
No, you leave.

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:48.400
Wait outside until I say otherwise.

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:49.060
But...

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:50.620
Just do as I say.

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:54.360
Be careful, sir.

00:02:59.590 --> 00:03:01.880
Boy with wings.

00:03:03.290 --> 00:03:07.200
I did not expect us to meet again so soon.

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:12.780
What is my mom... What is this woman doing here?

00:03:14.010 --> 00:03:15.380
Answer me!

00:03:17.970 --> 00:03:23.590
Do you know of the curse of Eve which was laid upon Altair?

00:03:24.210 --> 00:03:26.840
The curse of Eve?

00:03:42.970 --> 00:03:45.160
We should be safe for a bit longer now.

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:47.220
Thanks.

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:49.190
How do you feel?

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:51.910
My throat's still feels a little strange.

00:03:53.470 --> 00:03:54.910
Mine too.

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:58.170
Do you think the guys are okay?

00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:03.320
They're fine. I made them promise not to do anything stupid.

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:04.680
That's true.

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:07.640
They promised...

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:13.060
In exchange, I want you to promise me something.

00:04:16.070 --> 00:04:17.190
Zessica?

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:20.360
I'm okay! Nothing wrong here!

00:04:22.550 --> 00:04:28.200
Most of the sky is covered up on this planet.

00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:30.790
Weird, right?

00:04:31.720 --> 00:04:35.960
Maybe everyone on the planet longs for the sky,

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:38.790
and that's why they fantasize about the Skies of Aquaria.

00:04:40.140 --> 00:04:42.160
Like Jin...

00:04:53.670 --> 00:04:54.700
Yunoha!

00:05:04.690 --> 00:05:06.390
Damn, we were almost toast!

00:05:06.390 --> 00:05:06.940
What?

00:05:06.940 --> 00:05:08.660
What am I saying?

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:12.560
We're not safe here.

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:15.630
Great time for Shrade to be taking a walk.

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:18.490
I know, right? What a freaking flake.

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:35.070
I understand now.

00:05:35.820 --> 00:05:40.820
At last, I know the melody this world dances to.

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:44.720
What an ugly sky.

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:48.070
The life of this land is waning away.

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:51.970
Ha, how strange.

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:55.920
This land and I are much alike.

00:05:56.880 --> 00:05:59.420
Awaiting an imminent death.

00:06:00.510 --> 00:06:01.960
And so I understand you.

00:06:03.430 --> 00:06:05.800
I can feel your power flowing,

00:06:06.470 --> 00:06:09.820
and I can see the nexus of that power.

00:06:15.070 --> 00:06:17.300
Let me out, assholes!

00:06:17.300 --> 00:06:22.020
You can't keep me here! I told you to let me out!

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:28.280
What am I saying? I should thank them for bringing me here.

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:33.280
Hold on, Mix. I'm gonna find you...

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:40.210
I'm going to find him. I have to find High Commander Fudo...

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:42.380
That's why I've come this far.

00:06:43.980 --> 00:06:49.130
He really stands out, so it wasn't hard to track him here.

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:53.260
This is all I can do to help.

00:06:54.370 --> 00:06:56.910
I'm done running away.

00:06:56.910 --> 00:06:59.780
I'll find High Commander Fudo and take him back to the academy.

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:01.660
Right, Shush?

00:07:33.530 --> 00:07:35.220
High Commander Fudo!

00:07:36.270 --> 00:07:38.220
You certainly took your time.

00:07:38.670 --> 00:07:42.480
What do you mean? I've been looking as hard as I could!

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:44.290
Looking?

00:07:44.290 --> 00:07:45.320
Yes!

00:07:45.320 --> 00:07:47.900
Why did you have to look?

00:07:48.670 --> 00:07:51.840
I've been with you the entire time.

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:57.660
At the market, on the trolley, and all through this town.

00:07:57.660 --> 00:08:00.500
I did not move for but an instant.

00:08:06.300 --> 00:08:07.660
What?

00:08:07.660 --> 00:08:12.520
Though my body journeys across Creation, I move not.

00:08:12.520 --> 00:08:17.510
Though my soul lives throughout Eternity, I change not.

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:20.660
Change not? Move not?

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:23.020
You're "Fudo"...

00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:26.930
Exactly. Fudo, Achala, the Immovable.

00:08:26.930 --> 00:08:29.610
This is the meaning of the name Fudo Zen!

00:08:39.850 --> 00:08:43.860
High Commander Fudo, do you mean you've been alive for 12,000 years?

00:08:45.050 --> 00:08:48.450
Not quite. You should say 24,000 years.

00:08:49.610 --> 00:08:54.180
Mikono Suzushiro, do you wish to know the whole truth?

00:08:56.310 --> 00:09:00.560
I'm sure of it. I swore to myself I wouldn't run away.

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:04.810
No matter how hard it would be to take.

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:08.640
That will do.

00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:12.040
The truth...

00:09:12.890 --> 00:09:15.570
can be truly cruel.

00:09:16.690 --> 00:09:25.960
Fourteen years ago, all of the Igura, the women of Altair, died out.

00:09:28.990 --> 00:09:31.340
That's... Jin!

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:36.140
Jin Muso was the last child born on Altair.

00:09:36.140 --> 00:09:42.100
Do you understand now? A planet without Iguras is doomed to a slow death.

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:46.350
That's why you've been abducting women from our planet?

00:09:46.970 --> 00:09:52.610
All we want is a mother, to bear Altair's future.

00:09:52.610 --> 00:09:55.780
You think that gives you the right?!

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:03.370
The story is not yet done.

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:06.080
There is more to the truth you need to hear.

00:10:07.130 --> 00:10:10.170
And the rest is only more cruel.

00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:17.720
Just wait, Mix!

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:25.470
Where am I?

00:10:25.470 --> 00:10:26.780
Who are you?

00:10:26.780 --> 00:10:27.390
Damn you!

00:10:28.370 --> 00:10:31.380
Now, tell me! Where's Mix?

00:10:31.380 --> 00:10:32.270
Mix?

00:10:32.710 --> 00:10:36.900
The girl with gigantic big bangs! Your boss brought her here a while ago!

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:39.540
A girl? Oh, you mean...

00:10:39.540 --> 00:10:40.530
Where is she?!

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:43.260
Hold it right there!

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:48.530
Or the next hole's going to be bigger, and...

00:10:48.530 --> 00:10:50.370
Wait! I'll tell you!

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:51.100
Where is she?

00:10:51.100 --> 00:10:52.380
What's going on here?

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:01.220
Damn you!

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:10.490
I guess I'll let you off easy this time.

00:11:11.150 --> 00:11:15.900
Okay, my power just doesn't work on living things, but still!

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:17.640
He got away.

00:11:17.640 --> 00:11:19.030
The prisoner has escaped!

00:11:21.900 --> 00:11:29.700
I'll find you and hold you in my arms, Mix!

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:39.470
Where are we going now?

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:42.220
Mikono Suzushiro.

00:11:42.620 --> 00:11:46.860
What do you think of when you see this donut?

00:11:46.860 --> 00:11:51.480
Um... I think it looks tasty.

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:54.960
I hold this donut still in my hand.

00:11:54.960 --> 00:11:59.490
But in reality, it is crossing the waters as quickly as this boat.

00:12:00.510 --> 00:12:01.490
What?

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:06.240
You find nothing wondrous about a donut crossing the sea?

00:12:08.590 --> 00:12:10.370
And now the donut has vanished.

00:12:11.300 --> 00:12:13.000
Here is the secret:

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:17.250
Paradoxically, it is so close to you that you cannot see it.

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:23.260
And now it's in your stomach, High Commander.

00:12:23.910 --> 00:12:25.510
Are you certain?

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:33.240
The donut will be decomposed into its molecules, yet it will not truly disappear.

00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:38.360
It will be incorporated into my body, and from a certain point of view, become Immovable.

00:12:38.360 --> 00:12:41.930
You're talking in Zen koans.

00:12:41.930 --> 00:12:44.860
What did you mean by the "whole truth"?

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:52.370
There is an entity that has been "immovably" sustaining this world for 12,000 years.

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:55.120
Immovably?

00:12:55.730 --> 00:12:58.290
The Legendary Aquarion of myth.

00:12:59.030 --> 00:13:02.880
It lies sleeping at the end of this journey.

00:13:06.610 --> 00:13:11.270
This is pointless! I'm digging blind here!

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:13.150
There he is!

00:13:13.150 --> 00:13:17.150
Intruder sighted in block X33! Get him!

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:19.360
Damn! Stay away from me!

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:25.700
Take that!

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:34.960
I warned you. Keep out of my way.

00:13:35.880 --> 00:13:38.710
Commander Izumo's in the Alicia Room!

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:40.500
He's with the Vegan intruder!

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:42.210
Amata!

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:49.720
The curse of Eve did not end with the extinction of Iguras on Altair.

00:13:50.440 --> 00:13:56.730
It also affected the Iguras we took from your planet.

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:06.100
But at last we found Iguras powerful enough to resist the curse.

00:14:06.100 --> 00:14:08.740
Rare Iguras.

00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:11.240
Rare Iguras?

00:14:11.770 --> 00:14:19.500
But even the most powerful of the Rare Iguras, Alicia, could not be our true Eve.

00:14:20.230 --> 00:14:23.170
So what did you accomplish by taking away my mom?

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:28.930
All that I have done has been for Altair's future.

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:34.050
Because of some curse? And what about all the other women you took?

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:44.210
What's going on?

00:14:44.210 --> 00:14:46.690
Our radar and infrared sensors aren't picking anything up!

00:14:47.490 --> 00:14:49.380
The only one pinging is the graviton sensor!

00:14:49.380 --> 00:14:50.500
How far?

00:14:50.500 --> 00:14:51.450
Range: 90 klicks!

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:52.400
What?

00:14:52.400 --> 00:14:53.280
80!

00:14:54.070 --> 00:14:54.950
60!

00:14:55.670 --> 00:14:56.450
40!

00:14:57.190 --> 00:14:57.700
20!

00:14:58.750 --> 00:14:59.710
10!

00:15:00.650 --> 00:15:02.210
Range... 0!

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:10.300
Zessica, Yunoha! Are you all right?

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:15.640
I'm fine, but Yunoha's power is drained...

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:20.890
My body feels hot... What's going on?

00:15:21.770 --> 00:15:25.150
What the hell is this shit?

00:15:27.380 --> 00:15:28.580
My chest...

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:31.880
What's happening to their bodies?

00:15:32.430 --> 00:15:34.190
Shrade, do you read?

00:15:34.190 --> 00:15:37.370
Andy! Are you all right? Where are you?

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:39.940
Right under you! I'm in the tower!

00:15:53.710 --> 00:15:55.550
That was a fine entrance.

00:15:55.990 --> 00:15:58.430
Isn't Amata... with you?

00:15:58.430 --> 00:16:01.690
I think he's in something called the Alicia Room.

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:06.640
It can't be true...

00:16:06.640 --> 00:16:08.140
It is.

00:16:08.140 --> 00:16:13.000
Now you see the magnitude of the curse laid on Altair.

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:14.700
I can't believe that!

00:16:15.190 --> 00:16:17.880
At first, neither could we.

00:16:18.510 --> 00:16:22.000
But when it happened before our very eyes...

00:16:26.410 --> 00:16:28.300
That's Spada's sword!

00:16:28.710 --> 00:16:30.050
The Machine Angel!

00:16:30.530 --> 00:16:32.720
Amata! Get on!

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:33.680
Shrade?

00:16:34.210 --> 00:16:35.340
Don't forget me!

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:36.800
Andy!

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:40.970
Hurry! Zessica and Yunoha don't have much time!

00:16:41.880 --> 00:16:45.950
Amata... so that's your name.

00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:49.730
I have one more thing I absolutely have to tell you.

00:16:50.470 --> 00:16:53.240
Your father...

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:54.380
Commander Izumo!

00:16:54.380 --> 00:16:55.490
Please retreat!

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:57.060
There he is! Fire!

00:17:04.490 --> 00:17:05.790
Mom...

00:17:11.270 --> 00:17:13.400
I've called the other Vectors!

00:17:13.400 --> 00:17:15.930
Andy, Amata, take the seats!

00:17:16.310 --> 00:17:17.150
All right!

00:17:17.150 --> 00:17:17.680
Roger!

00:17:23.730 --> 00:17:26.350
Yunoha, Zessica! Fly up and stay there!

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:29.110
Sorry...

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:33.840
Don't screw it up, you morons...

00:17:33.840 --> 00:17:36.110
Yunoha, you sound...

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:37.530
Talk later! We've got incoming!

00:17:39.910 --> 00:17:42.540
It seems we cannot play the forbidden melody

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:45.860
without first fighting in a glorious concerto...

00:17:46.430 --> 00:17:47.310
Come!

00:17:47.310 --> 00:17:48.040
Right!

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:52.210
Boys' Union! Go, Aquarion!

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:03.680
Aquarion Spada!

00:18:06.630 --> 00:18:08.600
I'm sorry we can't stay for long.

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:11.910
We'll break through in the fastest <i>toccata</i> we can play!

00:18:14.170 --> 00:18:18.360
Upon a boys' moon, Moonlight Rhapsody!

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:31.250
Spatial Augmentation!

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:34.390
What happened?

00:18:34.390 --> 00:18:36.340
Something's filled the thruster exhausts!

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:38.470
Did you say filled?

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:48.040
That power... but it can't be!

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:50.130
That's Mix!

00:18:50.130 --> 00:18:50.820
What?

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:58.540
But that's the soldier that led us into a trap!

00:18:58.540 --> 00:19:00.110
Don't yank my chain like that!

00:19:00.110 --> 00:19:03.200
I'm not... I'm not kidding, Andy!

00:19:03.850 --> 00:19:05.270
What do you mean by that?

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:08.120
The curse of Eve is...

00:19:09.140 --> 00:19:15.280
Even those few Iguras lucky enough to survive here on Altair

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:19.550
transform into men in body and mind.

00:19:20.470 --> 00:19:21.800
Transform into men?

00:19:22.130 --> 00:19:25.020
This is Altair's doom.

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:28.520
The planet can never bear new life.

00:19:29.050 --> 00:19:30.780
That is the curse of Eve!

00:19:31.990 --> 00:19:37.070
That's Mix! She's just had her memories altered by the Altairian military!

00:19:41.170 --> 00:19:42.570
That can't be...

00:19:42.570 --> 00:19:45.260
If that's Mix, then I...

00:19:45.880 --> 00:19:47.600
I'll never make it with a girl...

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:52.330
And I found her and didn't even know it...

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:55.470
I'm about to crap out, you guys...

00:19:55.470 --> 00:19:56.290
Yunoha!

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:59.050
I'm losing consciousness, too...

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:01.300
Shrade, we have to get out of here!

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:02.930
They can't hold on much longer!

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:05.960
But even if we can break through the roof,

00:20:05.960 --> 00:20:07.810
they'll remain in danger unless we can escape the planet!

00:20:12.280 --> 00:20:19.440
Mix!

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:21.570
Andy!

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:25.300
What do you want from me?!

00:20:27.710 --> 00:20:29.740
His Element power is out of control!

00:20:30.410 --> 00:20:32.250
He's opening a hole in space!

00:20:33.510 --> 00:20:35.250
It's a nano-black hole!

00:20:40.010 --> 00:20:42.720
Andy, stop! Please!

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:47.840
No! I can conduct the scale of darkness!

00:20:51.030 --> 00:20:53.360
Find the note where the scales meet,

00:20:53.990 --> 00:20:57.100
the nexus of power to pierce the dimensions...

00:21:02.540 --> 00:21:07.700
Andy, focus your power into my arrow!

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:11.410
Black Hole Arrow!

00:21:25.340 --> 00:21:26.930
The gate's open!

00:21:29.080 --> 00:21:32.570
Amata, the rest is up to you.

00:21:40.700 --> 00:21:42.110
Yunoha, Zessica!

00:21:44.490 --> 00:21:50.400
Mix!

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:55.730
Wrong.

00:21:56.310 --> 00:21:58.920
My name... is Mixy!

00:22:00.740 --> 00:22:03.840
Splendid, absolutely splendid.

00:22:04.510 --> 00:22:08.080
The puzzle was in pieces, and now it's becoming whole.

00:22:09.210 --> 00:22:11.880
"The slumbering wings awaken..."

00:22:11.880 --> 00:22:16.810
Perhaps it means that the Wings of the Sun will be reborn.

00:22:17.450 --> 00:22:22.820
So the used trash Eve was good for something after all.

00:22:23.650 --> 00:22:29.320
Your awakening will come soon, little puzzle piece.

00:22:30.250 --> 00:22:33.080
Return to where everything began,

00:22:33.710 --> 00:22:37.420
and the last puzzle will be complete.

00:24:11.110 --> 00:24:12.680
If you could go back to where everything began

00:24:13.010 --> 00:24:15.120
and rewind it all like it never happened...

00:24:15.930 --> 00:24:19.680
There's so much I've lost, so much I'm going to lose.

00:24:19.680 --> 00:24:22.340
I can't take it.

00:24:23.270 --> 00:24:25.150
Next time: Kiss.
